%% title: Dispute Resolution Flow — openbank-dispute-service
sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as Customer / admin-UI
    participant DR as DisputeResource<br/>(REST :8135)
    participant DS as DisputeService<br/>(use cases)
    participant Repo as DisputeRepository<br/>(Panache / PG)
    participant Outbox as DisputeOutboxDispatcher<br/>(@Scheduled 5s)
    participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>openbank.disputes.dispute.event
    participant Consumers as audit-service<br/>/ notification

    Note over Customer,Consumers: Open a dispute
    Customer->>DR: POST /api/v1/disputes
    DR->>DS: openDispute(request)
    DS->>DS: generate reference DSP-<epochMillis>
    DS->>DS: compute resolutionDeadline = filingDate + 45d
    DS->>Repo: persist Dispute (status=OPEN, resolution=PENDING)
    DS->>Repo: append DisputeTimeline (OPENED, actor)
    Repo-->>DS: saved Dispute
    DS-->>DR: Dispute
    DR-->>Customer: 201 Created {id, reference, status=OPEN}

    Note over Customer,Consumers: Add evidence
    Customer->>DR: POST /api/v1/disputes/{id}/evidence
    DR->>DS: addEvidence(id, evidenceRequest)
    DS->>Repo: persist DisputeEvidence (fileReference, submittedBy)
    DS->>Repo: append DisputeTimeline (EVIDENCE_ADDED, actor)
    DR-->>Customer: 201 Created

    Note over Customer,Consumers: Status update (operator)
    Customer->>DR: PUT /api/v1/disputes/{id}
    DR->>DS: updateDispute(id, updateRequest)
    DS->>Repo: update Dispute (status, resolution, resolvedBy, resolvedAt)
    DS->>Repo: append DisputeTimeline (STATUS_CHANGED, actor)
    DR-->>Customer: 200 OK {updated Dispute}

    Note over Customer,Consumers: Withdraw
    Customer->>DR: POST /api/v1/disputes/{id}/withdraw?actor=…
    DR->>DS: withdraw(id, actor)
    DS->>DS: updateDispute → status=WITHDRAWN, resolution=WITHDRAWN
    DR-->>Customer: 200 OK

    Note over Customer,Consumers: Escalate
    Customer->>DR: POST /api/v1/disputes/{id}/escalate?actor=…
    DR->>DS: escalate(id, actor)
    DS->>DS: updateDispute → status=ESCALATED
    DR-->>Customer: 200 OK

    Note over Outbox,Consumers: Outbox → Kafka publish (async, every 5s)
    loop Every 5 seconds
        Outbox->>Repo: listProcessable(batch=25)
        Repo-->>Outbox: pending outbox rows
        Outbox->>Kafka: publishWithResilience(payload)<br/>[@Bulkhead(1) @CircuitBreaker @Retry(2) @Timeout(3s)]
        alt success
            Outbox->>Repo: markSent(eventId)
        else failure
            Outbox->>Repo: markFailed(eventId, error)
        end
    end
    Kafka-->>Consumers: DisputeEvent (audit / notification / card-issuance block)
